{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>Ephraim</b> — will be like a tree that was planted in a meadow and the waters covered it; so I saw in prophecy that the father goes out to the murderer of his sons."], :book :hosea, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {0 "Reading צור as 'tree' (as in כצור ארזים, related to צורה/תצורה), consistent with the image of something planted and covered by waters; alternatively the word may mean 'rock' or be textually uncertain."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Hosea -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=15&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:50:43.147271162Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}